{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash through levels at the speed of Pi, but watch out! You only have 3.14 seconds to beat each level!</strong> Easy as Pi is a difficult and fast paced speed running game where skill and optimization is rewarded!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536140/extras/ca95cab7df12fe84573eca91dee0dd0b.avif?t=1741939542\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pi, die, and try again!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Easy as Pi</i> you might die a lot,\u00a0but that just means you're learning! Explore 4 different areas with unique mechanics<i>,</i>\u00a0and collect hard-to-reach P.I.E.S. throughout your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536140/extras/33d9ccf785151adba35721a50ddfea36.avif?t=1741939542\" width=270 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Movement: Arrow keys;\u00a0WASD; Controller joystick/D-Pad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Quick Restart: R; Right trigger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Return to menu: Z; Left trigger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fullscreen: F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game auto-saves\u00a0upon room entry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Joystick not recommended.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 60 fast but very difficult levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 collectible P.I.E.S.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0\u00a0A special Finale level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An OST with 6 songs(Including\u00a0<i>Aeternum</i> and\u00a0<i>Impossibly Irrational</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Speed-running potential!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536140?t=1741939542","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536140?t=1741939542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536140/5b33e34c3345b05c70340946011164661c105b23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741939542","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536140/5b33e34c3345b05c70340946011164661c105b23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741939542","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash through levels at the speed of Pi, but watch out! You only have 3.14 seconds to beat each level!</strong> Easy as Pi is a difficult and fast paced speed running game where skill and optimization is rewarded!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536140/extras/ca95cab7df12fe84573eca91dee0dd0b.avif?t=1741939542\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pi, die, and try again!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Easy as Pi</i> you might die a lot,\u00a0but that just means you're learning! Explore 4 different areas with unique mechanics<i>,</i>\u00a0and collect hard-to-reach P.I.E.S. throughout your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536140/extras/33d9ccf785151adba35721a50ddfea36.avif?t=1741939542\" width=270 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Movement: Arrow keys;\u0